{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12230","headline":"奉陪使君十四叔晚憩大云门寺 · 钱起","name":"奉陪使君十四叔晚憩大云门寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野寺千家外，闲行晚暂过。\n炎氛临水尽，夕照傍林多。\n境对知心妄，人安觉政和。\n绳牀摇麈尾，佳趣满沧波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}